.npmrc
react-library/.npmrc

# Build artifacts that should never go to the upload — they're regenerated on Vercel.
.next
# Forensics + heap snapshots from scripts/next-memory-forensics.js / probe-dev-heap-cap.mjs.
memory-forensics-*
*.heapsnapshot
probe-results.json

# Tester plugin submodule — dev tooling only, never part of the app build.
# It carries @playwright/mcp + its own node_modules; shipping it inflates the
# upload, and an oversized bundle fails Vercel's "Deploying outputs..." step
# (CLAUDE.md Recurrent Root Cause #6).
#
# 🛑 The leading slash is load-bearing. .vercelignore uses gitignore semantics,
# so a bare `tester` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth — which also
# matched `src/app/[locale]/user/tester/`, stripping the Tester Hub page from
# the upload. The build then had no such route and /user/tester returned a hard
# 404 in production (X-Matched-Path: /404) while the page sat committed in the
# repo since 2026-08-17, so nothing local could reproduce it. Anchor every
# pattern here that names a root-level path.
/tester
